   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Externa arenor 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida also participates at several events that address certain         specific issues during 2014. Those are Stockholm Pride Festival, the  International Water week that are both arranged in Stockholm in       August as well as MR-dagarna that focus on Human Right&apos;s issues, in   Ume&#xe5; in November.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida deltar vid ett antal arenor under &#xe5;ret med ett mindre           deltagande som tillsammans utg&#xf6;r denna insats. Arenorna har specifik  fokus och innefattar 2014 Pride-festivalen och Internationella        vattenveckan som b&#xe5;de arrangeras i Stockholm i augusti, samt          MR-dagarna som arrangeras i Ume&#xe5; i november.</narrative>
  </description>
